<title>USA: South Umpqua Bank Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>South Umpqua Bank Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEBURG, Ore. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Umpqua Bank</p>
<p>		 Third Quarter Shareholder Report</p>
<p>			    (unaudited)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Sept. 30		  Sept. 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p>Net interest income</p>
<p>			$2,410,000 $2,078,000 $6,775,000 $5,970,000</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>   loan losses	 150,000    122,000    450,000    338,000</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>   income taxes	999,000    989,000  3,090,000  2,660,000</p>
<p> Net income	    636,000    624,000  1,929,000  1,685,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share (a)</p>
<p>				0.39	 0.38	 1.19	 1.04</p>
<p>						    As of Sept. 30,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Total assets			  $198,388,000    $170,420,000</p>
<p> Loans, net			     105,461,000	78,168,000</p>
<p> Total deposits			 171,205,000     148,626,000</p>
<p> Total stockholders' equity	  16,725,000	14,903,000</p>
<p>(a) Retroactively reflects a five for one stock split declared</p>
<p>	 in April 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
